 "title": "会议与身份",
 "pill": 4,
 "total": 105.04,
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg4-00",
   "text": "第二种手法，是一个会议。",
   "spoken": "第二种手法，是一个会议。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep21/audio/lines/seg4-00.wav",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 2.08,
   "speechStart": 1.693,
   "speechEnd": 3.451
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-01",
   "text": "攻击者冒充媒体或投资机构，邀请你参加访谈或路演。",
   "spoken": "攻击者冒充媒体或投资机构，邀请你参加访谈或路演。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep21/audio/lines/seg4-01.wav",
   "start": 3.9,
   "dur": 5.12,
   "speechStart": 3.996,
   "speechEnd": 8.824
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-02",
   "text": "然后要你下载一个专用会议软件，或者在会议里申请远程控制。",
   "spoken": "然后要你下载一个专用会议软件，或者在会议里申请远程控制。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep21/audio/lines/seg4-02.wav",
   "start": 9.24,
   "dur": 5.68,
   "speechStart": 9.34,
   "speechEnd": 14.677
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-03",
   "text": "2025 年 4 月，Trail of Bits 公开了一种做法。",
   "spoken": "2025 年 4 月，Trail of Bits 公开了一种做法。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep21/audio/lines/seg4-03.wav",
   "start": 15.14,
   "dur": 4.08,
   "speechStart": 15.246,
   "speechEnd": 19.005
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-04",
   "text": "攻击者在 Zoom 通话里，把自己的显示名改成 Zoom。",
   "spoken": "攻击者在 Zoom 通话里，把自己的显示名改成 Zoom。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep21/audio/lines/seg4-04.wav",
   "start": 19.44,
   "dur": 4.88,
   "speechStart": 19.44,
   "speechEnd": 24.125
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-05",
   "text": "弹窗写着 Zoom 请求控制你的屏幕，看起来像系统提示。",
   "spoken": "弹窗写着 Zoom 请求控制你的屏幕，看起来像系统提示。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep21/audio/lines/seg4-05.wav",
   "start": 24.54,
   "dur": 4.96,
   "speechStart": 24.634,
   "speechEnd": 29.294
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-06",
   "text": "但这里的 Zoom，只是一个参会者的名字。",
   "spoken": "但这里的 Zoom，只是一个参会者的名字。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep21/audio/lines/seg4-06.wav",
   "start": 29.72,
   "dur": 3.12,
   "speechStart": 29.72,
   "speechEnd": 32.628
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-07",
   "text": "点了同意，对方就能控制电脑，打开钱包或密码管理器。",
   "spoken": "点了同意，对方就能控制电脑，打开钱包或密码管理器。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep21/audio/lines/seg4-07.wav",
   "start": 33.06,
   "dur": 4.48,
   "speechStart": 33.153,
   "speechEnd": 37.358
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-08",
   "text": "同年 2 月，还有人发布假的 Web3 职位。",
   "spoken": "同年 2 月，还有人发布假的 Web3 职位。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep21/audio/lines/seg4-08.wav",
   "start": 37.76,
   "dur": 3.2,
   "speechStart": 37.76,
   "speechEnd": 40.773
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-09",
   "text": "引导求职者安装 GrassCall 会议软件，里面是窃密木马。",
   "spoken": "引导求职者安装 GrassCall 会议软件，里面是窃密木马。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep21/audio/lines/seg4-09.wav",
   "start": 41.18,
   "dur": 4.56,
   "speechStart": 41.271,
   "speechEnd": 45.566
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-10",
   "text": "第三种手法，是把人直接送进公司。",
   "spoken": "第三种手法，是把人直接送进公司。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep21/audio/lines/seg4-10.wav",
   "start": 45.96,
   "dur": 3.44,
   "speechStart": 45.96,
   "speechEnd": 49.193
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-11",
   "text": "攻击者用盗用或伪造的身份，应聘远程开发岗位。",
   "spoken": "攻击者用盗用或伪造的身份，应聘远程开发岗位。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep21/audio/lines/seg4-11.wav",
   "start": 49.62,
   "dur": 4.64,
   "speechStart": 49.62,
   "speechEnd": 54.085
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-12",
   "text": "美国检方在 2025 年 6 月，起诉了 4 名朝鲜人。",
   "spoken": "美国检方在 2025 年 6 月，起诉了 4 名朝鲜人。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep21/audio/lines/seg4-12.wav",
   "start": 54.48,
   "dur": 4.64,
   "speechStart": 54.574,
   "speechEnd": 58.985
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-13",
   "text": "他们冒名受雇于区块链公司，其中一人修改了雇主两个智能合约的源码。",
   "spoken": "他们冒名受雇于区块链公司，其中一人修改了雇主两个智能合约的源码。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep21/audio/lines/seg4-13.wav",
   "start": 59.34,
   "dur": 5.92,
   "speechStart": 59.34,
   "speechEnd": 65.084
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-14",
   "text": "把约 74 万美元转到自己的地址，全案约 91.5 万美元。",
   "spoken": "把约 74 万美元转到自己的地址，全案约 91.5 万美元。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep21/audio/lines/seg4-14.wav",
   "start": 65.48,
   "dur": 5.92,
   "speechStart": 65.579,
   "speechEnd": 71.172
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-15",
   "text": "最后一种，是一笔钱。",
   "spoken": "最后一种，是一笔钱。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep21/audio/lines/seg4-15.wav",
   "start": 71.62,
   "dur": 2.0,
   "speechStart": 71.712,
   "speechEnd": 73.444
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-16",
   "text": "2025 年 5 月，攻击者用现金，收买了 Coinbase 的海外外包客服。",
   "spoken": "2025 年 5 月，攻击者用现金，收买了 Coinbase 的海外外包客服。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep21/audio/lines/seg4-16.wav",
   "start": 73.84,
   "dur": 5.84,
   "speechStart": 73.84,
   "speechEnd": 79.48
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-17",
   "text": "导出约 7 万名用户的数据，再冒充 Coinbase 行骗。",
   "spoken": "导出约 7 万名用户的数据，再冒充 Coinbase 行骗。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep21/audio/lines/seg4-17.wav",
   "start": 79.9,
   "dur": 4.24,
   "speechStart": 79.992,
   "speechEnd": 83.922
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-18",
   "text": "Coinbase 估算，成本约 1.8 亿到 4 亿美元。",
   "spoken": "Coinbase 估算，成本约 1.8 亿到 4 亿美元。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep21/audio/lines/seg4-18.wav",
   "start": 84.36,
   "dur": 4.24,
   "speechStart": 84.462,
   "speechEnd": 88.443
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-19",
   "text": "同年 7 月，CoinDCX 的一名员工被兼职工作吸引，在公司电脑上装了恶意软件。",
   "spoken": "同年 7 月，CoinDCX 的一名员工被兼职工作吸引，在公司电脑上装了恶意软件。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep21/audio/lines/seg4-19.wav",
   "start": 88.82,
   "dur": 6.88,
   "speechStart": 88.82,
   "speechEnd": 95.484
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-20",
   "text": "运营钱包被盗走约 4400 万美元，当地警方称，这名员工并不知情，只是被利用了。",
   "spoken": "运营钱包被盗走约 4400 万美元，当地警方称，这名员工并不知情，只是被利用了。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep21/audio/lines/seg4-20.wav",
